  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Trailers Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The acquisition of two additional solar trailers for LRC. This expansion of solar trailer deployment is envisioned as a pivotal enhancement to LRC&apos;s operational efficiency and responsiveness on a nationwide scale. The strategic usage of these additional solar trailers holds the potential to significantly reduce emergency response times, thereby fortifying LRC&apos;s ability to address crises swiftly and effectively throughout the entire country. Upon receipt, the solar trailers will be securely stored in the central warehouse, ensuring their accessibility and readiness for deployment. The solar trailers are indispensable for a wide array of intervention and support activities, including:


- BTS Blood Drive Campaigns

- Search and Rescue (SAR) and Urban Search and Rescue (USAR) Missions

- Vaccination Projects

- Emergency Operations

- Electricity Support for LRC Centers</narrative>
  </description>
